abstract: |2-
  Virtual Soil Simulator (VSS) is an open-source finite volume method solver
  for water transport in unsaturated porous media, built as a custom solver
  within the OpenFOAM framework. It implements Richards' equation extended with
  thin-film flow and isothermal vapor transport phenomena, enabling simulation
  of water movement in soils under complex hydraulic conditions.
